# Objective 5 (compiler-only): the built-in optimizer removes rules that cannot
# change any decision, and the verifier proves nothing changed. Expected: 9 -> 6 IR rules.
SUBJECT manager, clerk, guest
RESOURCE invoices SUPPORTS READ, WRITE
RESOURCE ledger   SUPPORTS READ

ALLOW manager ACCESS invoices
ALLOW manager WRITE invoices WHEN mfa        # covered by the ACCESS rule above
ALLOW clerk READ invoices WHEN on_shift
ALLOW clerk READ invoices WHEN on_shift      # exact duplicate
DENY guest ACCESS invoices
ALLOW guest READ invoices                    # the DENY above always wins
ALLOW clerk READ ledger
